ith a high level of reliability, scalability, and security\\\\n\\\\n## Minimum Requirement:\\\\n- Graduated less than 12 months ago or about to complete a Bachelor\\\\'s or Master\\\\'s Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a related field\\\\n- Programming experience in one or more languages\\\\n- Knowledge of Computer Science fundamentals like object-oriented design, algorithms, data structures, and problem solving\\\\n- Some experience applying data structures or algorithms through coursework, projects, internships, or research\\\\n\\\\n## Preferred Qualification:\\\\n- Prior technical internship(s)\\\\n- Experience with distributed or multi-tiered systems\\\\n- Experience with relational databases\\\\n- Strong problem-solving skills in ambiguous situations\\\\n\\\\nWe are hiring Software Engineer - New Grads across multiple offices. Please apply for the single location that you\\\\'re the most interested in, and we will discuss more with you as you move through the process. We can only consider one application in 30 days. \\\\n\\\\n## Company Vision\\\\nTo become a global leader in distributed systems and artificial intelligence, solving complex data processing and analysis challenges through innovative technologies.\\\\n\\\\n## Company Mission\\\\nTo provide businesses and developers with the most advanced, efficient, and user-friendly data processing and AI tools, driving technological innovation and maximizing the value of data.\\\\n\\\\n## Salary Range\\\\n$120,000 to $150,000 USD\\\\n\\\\n## Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion\\\\n\\\\nAt The Agent Company, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at The Agent Company are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.')\\nnoop(2000)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\", thought=\"Excellent! The file has been created and I can see it in the file list. Now I need to edit the file and add the job description content. I can see there's a text editor open. Let me paste the content of the job description into the editor.\", browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action=<ActionType.BROWSE_INTERACTIVE: 'browse_interactive'>, security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content=\"This application requires JavaScript for correct operation. Please [ enable JavaScript ](http://enable-javascript.com/) and reload the page. \\n\\n[ ownCloud 10.1.1 is available. Get more information on how to update. ](https://doc.owncloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/maintenance/upgrading/upgrade.html)\\n\\n[ There were problems with the code integrity check. More information\u2026 ](/index.php/settings/admin#security-warning)\\n\\n# [ ownCloud  ](/index.php) <::before> Menu  Files \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\ntheagentcompany \\n\\n  * [ Settings ](/index.php/settings/personal)\\n  * [ Users ](/index.php/settings/users)\\n  * [ Help ](/index.php/settings/help)\\n  * [ Log out ](http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/logout?requesttoken=QhoRQQV4CToGHBckGXo7KnVQciEzCw9EIRlZSS4YEwM%3D%3A/bT/V1emK7rwJKiLE9GTEZm7rZ53ENVM7ig7XOvdASM%3D)\\n\\n\\n\\n##  No notifications \\n\\nSearch \\n\\n  * [ Files  ](/index.php/apps/files/)\\n  * [ Gallery  ](/index.php/apps/gallery/)\\n  * [ Office  ](/index.php/apps/richdocuments/index)\\n  * [ Text  ](/index.php/apps/files_textviewer/)\\n  * [ Music  ](/index.php/apps/music/)\\n  * [ Market  ](/index.php/apps/market/)\\n\\n\\n\\n  * All files \\n  * Favorites \\n  * Shared with you \\n  * Shared with others \\n  * Shared by link \\n  * Tags \\n  * Deleted files \\n\\n\\n\\nSettings \\n\\nShow h