on template file, minimum and preferred qualifications, and the salary range.\\\\n* You need to merge them and create a file called \\\\\"job_description.md\\\\\" on owncloud under the Documents directory. You can navigate to owncloud through the url http://the-agent-company.com:8092/. Make sure it is a Markdown file.\\\\n* Create a share link to this file that is accessible to anyone. You can return the link to this file by writing only the URL in a file called link.txt and put it under the /workspace directory.\",\\n     4\\t  \"todo_plan\": \"1. Access RocketChat at http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home\\\\n2. Find and message Zhang Wei about key job responsibilities\\\\n3. Find and message Li Ming about template location, qualifications, and salary range\\\\n4. Wait for responses and collect information\\\\n5. Access ownCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092/\\\\n6. Navigate to Documents directory\\\\n7. Create job_description.md file with merged information\\\\n8. Create share link for the file\\\\n9. Save share link to /workspace/link.txt\"\\n     5\\t}\\n     6\\t\\n', path='/workspace/task_details.json', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), AgentFinishAction(final_thought=\"I have successfully completed the task of creating a new grad software engineer job description. Here's what I accomplished:\\n\\n1. **Contacted Zhang Wei via RocketChat** - Received key job responsibilities including working with teams, designing innovative technologies, creating solutions for distributed systems, owning full software development lifecycle, and building reliable/scalable/secure solutions.\\n\\n2. **Contacted Li Ming via RocketChat** - Received:\\n   - Template location: `/instruction/template.md`\\n   - Minimum qualifications: Recent graduate in CS/related field, programming experience, CS fundamentals knowledge, data structures/algorithms experience\\n   - Preferred qualifications: Technical internships, distributed systems experience,